    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overview:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project 2025 Text Based Story Board is an AI-powered interactive story creation platform that enables users to craft unique narratives using their own AI service APIs. This tool does not include any built-in API keys - users must provide their own valid AI service credentials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Core Features\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Trilingual Support: Full compatibility with Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, and English</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic Story Engine: Generates organic narrative branching</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010System Requirements\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Valid AI service API key (e.g., DeepSeek/Local LLM)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Stable internet connection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Basic text processing capability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project 2025 Text Based Story Board is a narrative tool that transforms your AI service API into a powerful storytelling engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Important Notice]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This tool does not include any built-in API services. Users must provide their own valid AI service credentials to access all features.</p>",
